      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The scientific consensus is built on the understanding that human experience involves both objective biology and subjective psychology. To insist that gender identity is *only* a feeling ignores decades of psychological research into self-perception. The view that rigidly forces gender identity to conform solely to biological sex is an outdated, reductionist perspective that fails to account for the complexity of human neurology and identity.",
      "source": "target",
